# Brick debris: a chunk of the terracotta brick tile (E light, n body,
# R shadow/mortar side) with a k outline. Spin = the chunk tumbles a
# quarter turn between the two frames (lit edge stays top left).
sprite = debris
size   = 8x8
origin = 4,8
hitbox = 1,1,6,6
anim   = spin frames=2 ticks=4 loop
---
frame spin 0
........
.kkkkk..
.kEEEnk.
.kEnnnRk
.knnnnRk
.knnRRRk
..kkkkk.
........
frame spin 1
........
..kkkk..
.kEEnnk.
.kEnnnk.
.knnnRk.
.knnnRk.
.kRRRRk.
..kkkk..
